# Typography — single font family

## Font

- **Family:** [DM Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/DM+Sans) (Google Fonts, free).
- **Token:** `--font-sans` in `src/style.css` (`:root`).
- **Aliases:** `--heading` and `--mono` must equal `var(--font-sans)` — do not introduce a second display or monospace face unless the user explicitly asks.

## Rules

1. Load the font once in `src/fonts.css`; import that file from `src/style.css` and from any other game/page stylesheet.
2. Set `font-family: var(--font-sans)` on `html`, `body`, headings, buttons, inputs, textareas, and labels.
3. Use **font-weight** (400 body, 500–600 UI labels, 700 headings) and size/spacing for hierarchy — not a different typeface.
4. Do not add Orbitron, Chakra Petch, Share Tech Mono, or other fonts to this project without user approval.
5. New pages or games under this repo must import the same tokens or `style.css`; no local `font-family` overrides except `inherit`.

## Weights in use

- 400 — body copy, paragraphs, form placeholders  
- 500–600 — nav, chips, uppercase labels, stats  
- 700 — hero titles, section headings, buttons  
